%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8457553d7570b1146a94bd661e6d7528, type: 3}
  m_Name: Grain Reserves Mission
  missionName: Grain Reserves
  description: "The swarm can strip a harvest in days, but famine can still be prevented through reserve discipline. Finish the infestation with at least {Objective0Target} Food in storage so the population can outlast the shock."
  splashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e70554ff2ddad1041825cdaa2db4a4d4, type: 3}
  victorySplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5d30cffec96ce4447a09525dcb68c408, type: 3}
  failureSplashImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65911d141ac1a564893e776ee98d77ac, type: 3}
  flavorText: "Fields that looked secure yesterday may be bare tomorrow under a darkened sky. In this crisis, survival depends less on what grows this turn and more on what was set aside before panic began. Granary management, ration control, and protected transport now matter as much as farming itself. Leaders must resist pressure to spend reserves too early and too broadly. The swarm feeds on crops; we endure on foresight."
  victoryFlavorText: "Reserve targets were achieved, and granaries closed the crisis with enough stock to prevent immediate famine. Urban markets remained supplied, military ration chains stayed intact, and forced migration pressure eased. The swarm caused damage, but not systemic hunger. Stored grain became the margin between hardship and collapse."
  failureFlavorText: "Reserves fell below survival thresholds before the infestation ended. Consumption outran storage discipline, disrupted harvests were not compensated, and emergency requisitioning arrived too late to stabilize supply. Hunger now drives unrest, displacement, and coercive policy choices. The swarm won not only in fields, but in our granaries."
  participantRole: 0
  strategyTags: 34
  objectives:
  - objectiveName: Grain Reserves
    description: Finish the infestation with at least {Objective0Target} Food in reserve.
    type: 10
    targetValue: 0
    targetMode: 3
    targetMultiplier: 2
    minimumTarget: 20
    maximumTarget: 200
    completionTiming: 1
  constraints: []
  rewardTiers:
  - tierName: Complete
    requiredObjectivesCompleted: 1
    rewardLegacy: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 48c5619221ed4b39b4845e4e1f10a975, type: 2}
